{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>התרעישנו כארבה</b> — that it make a sound for him in its running, just as is heard from a locust." "<b>הוד נחרו</b> — like: נחרת סוסיו (the snorting of his horses); the sound of the horse's neighing."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 39, :notes {0 "Resolved kaf in כארבה as locust (ארבה), reading the comparison as the horse's sound likened to the locust's."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:05:15.234794488Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}